echun-xiehan:p001","text":"純字景懋，景仁弟也。劉毅鎮江陵，以爲衛軍長史、南平相。及王鎮惡襲毅，毅時病，佐史聞兵至，馳還入府，左右引車欲還外廨，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲安之。」及入，毅兵敗眾散，純爲人所殺。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"純","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0000","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":2,"end":4,"surface":"景懋","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0002","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":5,"end":7,"surface":"景仁","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005","person_id":"684_eaa_511","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝裕。"},{"start":10,"end":12,"surface":"劉毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0010","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":28,"end":31,"surface":"王鎮惡","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0028","person_id":"quq_d6y_akf","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作王鎮惡。"},{"start":32,"end":33,"surface":"毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0032","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":34,"end":35,"surface":"毅","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0034","person_id":"a59_2c3_a2e","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作劉毅。"},{"start":38,"end":40,"surface":"佐史","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0038","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"未具名佐史，馳還入府的主語依本傳句法與平行本分錄。"},{"start":49,"end":51,"surface":"左右","id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:u0049","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"引車的隨從未具名。"},{"start":58,"end":59,"surface":"純","id":"c-n